<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the third</p>
<p>day of four-day Sheffield Shield cricket matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>In Sydney: New South Wales 296 and 141, Queensland 330 and</p>
<p>44-1.</p>
<p>In Melbourne: Victoria 345-9 declared,  South Australia 84</p>
<p>and 214-5 (Geoff Parker 52 not out, Ben Johnson 52).</p>
<p>In Perth: Tasmania 473-6 declared and 133-0 (Jamie Cox 66</p>
<p>not out, Dene Hills 57 not out), Western Australia 326-4</p>
<p>declared (Justin Langer 143 not out, Tom Moody 114).</p>
</text>
